{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Before the cyclists take off, the advertising caravan steals the show. In <strong>Caravane</strong>, a bullet heaven turned upside down, you don\u2019t spread chaos, you spread joy. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the Road!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each run takes you on a procedurally generated Tour de France road. Every tile of countryside, town, or mountain changes the way you drive. Dodge obstacles, swerve through hazards, and stay sharp: one mistake could slow you down, and the peloton never forgives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.poster.avif?t=1770015326\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.webm?t=1770015326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.mp4?t=1770015326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spread the Joy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forget bullets, your weapons are goodies! Stickers, hats, snacks, and surprises burst out of your truck to delight the cheering crowd. Every hit raises their excitement and pushes your score higher. It\u2019s chaos, it\u2019s colorful, and it\u2019s all about joy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Peloton</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Behind you, the peloton is always chasing. Keep your pace or risk being swallowed whole. The thrill isn\u2019t just surviving the road \u2013 it\u2019s outrunning the pack, with the roar of cyclists closing in every second you waste.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/acf11c5e8cfa314a4a28144c2dfb3105.avif?t=1770015326\" width=900 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Playful Sticker World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Caravane embraces a playful sticker-art style: hand-drawn trucks, bright outlines, cartoon crowds, and colorful chaos. It feels like cutting out stickers and throwing them on a living board game. A style as fun as the ride itself!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/ebaa0feaf706cb9f693b2bd5aea49921.avif?t=1770015326\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet heaven reversed</strong> \u2192 Spread joy instead of destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural roads</strong> \u2192 Every run creates a new Tour de France stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The peloton is coming</strong> \u2192 Keep your speed or get swallowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodies as weapons</strong> \u2192 Stickers, snacks, and surprises for the crowd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sticker-art visuals</strong> \u2192 A playful world that looks hand-made.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-6 hours of play time.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi! I\u2019m Thomas BloodyHand, a solo dev from France. I made Caravane as a tiny, cheerful game inspired by the Tour de France caravans I\u2019ve loved since childhood. It\u2019s short, simple, and made to bring a smile \u2014 thanks for giving it a ride!</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4008070?t=1770015326","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/bcf2935d7ba3a304d65b7dd920f1b29e936be8e0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770015326","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/b9c5a5a8df742995cd6f84533cacdba132e8a8dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770015326","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/b9c5a5a8df742995cd6f84533cacdba132e8a8dd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770015326","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Before the cyclists take off, the advertising caravan steals the show. In <strong>Caravane</strong>, a bullet heaven turned upside down, you don\u2019t spread chaos, you spread joy. </i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drive the Road!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Each run takes you on a procedurally generated Tour de France road. Every tile of countryside, town, or mountain changes the way you drive. Dodge obstacles, swerve through hazards, and stay sharp: one mistake could slow you down, and the peloton never forgives.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.poster.avif?t=1770015326\" width=900 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.webm?t=1770015326\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/de98c54083aa2f423ef464fed8ce580e.mp4?t=1770015326\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spread the Joy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Forget bullets, your weapons are goodies! Stickers, hats, snacks, and surprises burst out of your truck to delight the cheering crowd. Every hit raises their excitement and pushes your score higher. It\u2019s chaos, it\u2019s colorful, and it\u2019s all about joy.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Escape the Peloton</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Behind you, the peloton is always chasing. Keep your pace or risk being swallowed whole. The thrill isn\u2019t just surviving the road \u2013 it\u2019s outrunning the pack, with the roar of cyclists closing in every second you waste.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/acf11c5e8cfa314a4a28144c2dfb3105.avif?t=1770015326\" width=900 height=506 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Playful Sticker World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Caravane embraces a playful sticker-art style: hand-drawn trucks, bright outlines, cartoon crowds, and colorful chaos. It feels like cutting out stickers and throwing them on a living board game. A style as fun as the ride itself!</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/extras/ebaa0feaf706cb9f693b2bd5aea49921.avif?t=1770015326\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet heaven reversed</strong> \u2192 Spread joy instead of destruction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural roads</strong> \u2192 Every run creates a new Tour de France stage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The peloton is coming</strong> \u2192 Keep your speed or get swallowed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Goodies as weapons</strong> \u2192 Stickers, snacks, and surprises for the crowd.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sticker-art visuals</strong> \u2192 A playful world that looks hand-made.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4-6 hours of play time.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hi! I\u2019m Thomas BloodyHand, a solo dev from France. I made Caravane as a tiny, cheerful game inspired by the Tour de France caravans I\u2019ve loved since childhood. It\u2019s short, simple, and made to bring a smile \u2014 thanks for giving it a ride!</i></p>","developers":["BloodyHand"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4008070/8122903c1c5b3d90c1da02f7971d33cab5b0b210/header.jpg?t=1770015326","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008070/1519230797/6c9c7b697396d09b36b8359afedccd8bd3592611/1758873184/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758874390","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008070/1519230797/6c9c7b697396d09b36b8359afedccd8bd3592611/1758873184/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758874390","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4008070/1519230797/6c9c7b697396d09b36b8359afedccd8bd3592611/1758873184/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758874390","id":257206700,"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://